 {"file_name": "Screenshot_03.png", "id": "750887156432789", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001724_750887159766122_1493923655041025906_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fPd3fLPsn4QQ7kNvwEbLlv3&_nc_oc=AdryrUENM0anBkeC0KfCcrkNNlwxgi2_yLz0RxmYBMiO4NtfzUkYvVRnJKaqy8o_ERU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4LaI9QKtvn4THroamVvlEpXc3DtiwG1cxWQDy0sjF4fQ&oe=6A1AEC37"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_04.png", "id": "911467930162886", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003243_911467933496219_5018844149446080143_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=whprWZH8ZlIQ7kNvwGsgO9p&_nc_oc=AdqqpWdG0LLg22KkW-43uHXhnrufH3mjybbs5VzAd9tdS9ibschPt0biuLHJLSjK9M0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6b8QN2NTyBHwczMp5fdHXltEKwus9WnIxbxcERxH3dkw&oe=6A1AEC01"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_05.png", "id": "174155445030577", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222945_174155448363910_8892028513575383207_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qyuvCjl1gKcQ7kNvwH6mYmy&_nc_oc=Adr1gvJFpwI0WWa7QONFf3qFQ0UMdD0N_tHfVqXDU2wMHatQBDOsjHTN67PC_0AV63E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af71nQloLFp0qjMXe6qQtXbnFN_tFFHFdqTA5ujhFfDdLQ&oe=6A1AE311"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverShot_Sky.png", "id": "757988159035053", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974736_757988162368386_3128866040929659758_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i8jvGVYrxJ0Q7kNvwEoF8Qm&_nc_oc=AdrTY2R7MtSj6RDtdaHGp6QM8VXzjATFc5FFPBbOlCRG8LfA99xWhsj0JBkZiNKosJw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af76sWlg7qrGGf3TLIrciZbZCtcMU078fwsLwgqrEz0NxA&oe=6A1B0421"}, "display_name": "Sky Squadron", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to keep Australia\u2019s skies safe?\n\nThe tropical island paradise is being invaded, and only hot-shot Keith Koala can jump into the gunner\u2019s seat and fend off some of the most menacing meanies that the Aussie Islands have ever seen! Grab the controls hands-on to blow fearsome foes out of the sky in thrilling aerial combat before they plunder everything your home has to offer.\n\nFeatures\n- An Australian take on the beloved \u201cStar Fox\u201d rail shooter formula, combined with thrilling WW2 gunner gameplay.\n- Experience a koala-ty cast of Aussie animals fighting to survive against invasive enemies!\n- Use devastating powerups to take those drongos down! \n- Blast through every mission alongside your friends in seamless online co-op.\n- Branching missions & varied objectives. \n- Tear apart foul foes piece by piece\u2026 literally! With dynamic and fully destructible bosses.\n- Dominate the skies and claim your rightful position as an apex species with global leaderboards available for every single mission.", "short_description": "Jump in the bloomin' gunner seat as Keith Koala to save your mates & their island paradise from the evil invading empire! Sky Squadron offers a unique Aussie twist on shooter classics like Star Fox and Panzer Dragoon, while adding thrilling & immersive VR gunner gameplay."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTsVR5zvtVSLBBmnyuJCb-8vKqFCG-v4egtNg28sD4SLsCwkJ3DAw8CC41bEaKPMxi0wxDfMeQYD9ee/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Trick Shot Development", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.trickshotdev.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOV